  "chapter": {
    "number": 124,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "hebrew_subtitle",
        "content": [
          "(125) A Song of Degrees."
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "They that trust in the Lord shall be as mount Sion: he that dwells in Jerusalem shall never be moved.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The mountains are round about her, and so the Lord is round about his people, from henceforth and even for ever.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "For the Lord will not allow the rod of sinners to be upon the lot of the righteous; lest the righteous should stretch forth their hands to iniquity.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Do good, O Lord, to them that are good, and to them that are upright in heart.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "But them that turn aside to crooked ways the Lord will lead away with the workers of iniquity:",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "noteId": 231
          },
          {
            "text": "but peace shall be upon Israel.",
            "poem": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": [
      {
        "noteId": 231,
        "caller": "+",
        "text": "Or, let peace be.",
        "reference": {
          "chapter": 124,
          "verse": 5
        }
      }
    ]
  },
